  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "\"Find Friend\" - once you join a world your friend is in, in the social tab you send out a request to Find Friend, the friend gets a popup window asking \"A friend wants to find you! Allow or Deny?\" If that friend clicks Allow then you will see an arrow-compass pointing in the friend's direction (compass aims up or down too depending on multilevel maps) arrow dissapears when you reach within 5 feet of friend. Alternatively if the friend clicks denied it notifies you \"Find Friend Denied!\" So you know they werent being afk or something.",
